01_simulate_datasets.R: used to generate datasets resembling the dataset used in
                        the case study: similar probability of recapture,
                        similar probability of being fitted with a tracking collar
                        or a GLS tag, similar lifespan of tracking collars and 
                        GLS tags, etc.
                
02_run_model.R: used to analyze the simulated datasets with the CR model presented
                in the article. The outputs are used to plot figures.